# Ollama Provider Config


## Skills

- **tinyfish** (`Skills/tinyfish/`): Wraps the TinyFish CLI for web search, fetch, browser automation, and vault credentials. Auth key stored in Zo Secrets as `TINYFISH_API_KEY`.
  - Usage: `bun run Skills/tinyfish/scripts/tinyfish.ts <command>`
  - Subcommands: `auth`, `connect`, `search query`, `fetch content`, `browser session`, `agent run`, `vault`, `profile`, `config-claude`

## Service / runtime (host-side)

- Container IP: `172.20.33.184` (updated from `172.20.17.188` after sandbox/container restart — verify with `hostname -I` or `curl` before using)
- Ollama (`ollama serve`): localhost `127.0.0.1:11434` only (`--host 127.0.0.1`)
- Proxy (`Skills/ollama-proxy/scripts/proxy.ts`): `*:11435`, forces `stream: false` and strips unsupported params (`services`, `tools`, ...) for `/v1/chat/completions`

